WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.462
I have a tiny mirror.

2
00:00:10.463 --> 00:00:18.803
This is my toothbrush.

3
00:00:18.804 --> 00:00:27.116
I have some floss.

4
00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:35.480
This is my big chair.

5
00:00:35.481 --> 00:00:43.768
I have patients.

6
00:00:43.769 --> 00:00:52.097
This is my waiting room.

7
00:00:52.098 --> 00:00:59.912
I have a mask.

8
00:00:59.913 --> 00:01:08.009
Who am I?

9
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:16.131
I am a dentist.

